  "bodyHash": "e5d594d9dc6aca5f",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#930\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/496/69/bh_sbp_header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"424\">本模组仅适用于 Fabric API，如需一款适合 Forge 的精美简易背包模组，请尝试：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useful-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useful-backpacks</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#843fa1\"><strong>注意：在 1.21+ 版本中已移除包裹和便携合成桌。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000080\"><strong>统一尺寸背包（54 格）。&nbsp;无阶位、无需按键绑定、不可染色、不可放入胸甲栏或地面、不支持饰品栏。&nbsp;仅是一款“简单”的背包，可在游戏早期制作。</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/496/72/bh_sbp_promo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"246\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/496/70/bh_sbp_banner2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 拥有 54 格的简易背包</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 虚空背包，本质上是一个便携式垃圾箱，关闭界面时物品将被删除</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 末影背包，可随身携带并访问玩家的末影箱</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 简易包裹，类似于原版包裹但容量大得多</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 虚空包裹，专为丢弃物品设计的包裹</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 附带便携合成桌，方便随时快捷合成</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>注意：</strong>出于安全考虑，背包不能放入其他背包或虚空背包中。&nbsp;潜影盒也不能放入背包，以防止无限存储。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/474/89/screen-shot-2022-07-04-at-8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"404\" height=\"510\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>注意：</strong>配方中可使用任意原版羊毛。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">背包（储物）：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/474/90/screen-shot-2022-07-04-at-8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"404\" height=\"169\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">末影背包（末影储物）：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/474/91/screen-shot-2022-07-04-at-8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"401\" height=\"168\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">虚空背包（丢弃）：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/474/92/screen-shot-2022-07-04-at-8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"167\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">便携合成桌 - 手中的合成台</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/457/812/screen-shot-2022-04-27-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"433\" height=\"196\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">简易包裹</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/402/251/screen-shot-2021-10-19-at-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"431\" height=\"403\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">简易包裹：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/436/382/screen-shot-2022-02-27-at-11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"177\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">虚空包裹（丢弃）：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/436/383/screen-shot-2022-02-27-at-11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"177\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>警告：</strong>放入虚空背包的物品在关闭界面时将被删除，请谨慎操作。&nbsp;出于安全考虑，背包、末影背包和虚空背包均不可放入虚空背包中。</span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/496/71/bh_sbp_banner3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
